        },
        {
          "text": " Nji ejo Olaitoriani: “Ore too nkitarruorrot uni e Moab, o tiong'uan, maiwuang'ie nanu enkitamioto enye, amu etapejo ninye aitaa nkuruon iloik lo laiguanani le Edom. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku kairriwaa nanu enkima shumata Moab, naa kenya isempewueti le Keriot, naa keye Moab te mpolos e enkishirata te mpolos e mbuata o to ltoilo le ntarumpeta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaiwuang'ie nanu olaiguanani te mpolos e Moab, naar metuata ilkituaak lenyena te nebo ninye Olaitoriani ojo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.2.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
