              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nji ejo Olaitoriani: “Ore too nkitarruorrot uni e Israel, o tiong'uan maiwuang'ie nanu enkitamioto enye; amu kemir ninche ilo asipani te nkosholai nemir ilo omena aainosie inamuka are. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninche lelo ooitunyoki endukuya o laisinani enterit e nkop, neibelekeny enkoitoi eilo oibookoki enkop nelo olayioni o menye ayiaya enkitok nabo, neidurukie ninche enkarna ai sinyati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neirrag ninche te mbata e pooki perere lo lasar too nkilani naalakieki isilen; naa ore tiatua enkaji e Nkai enye neok ninche enaisho e lelo ooitalaaki esile.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.2.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
