            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.3.8+DEU.3.9+DEU.3.10+DEU.3.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enkig 3.8-11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Ore eyia aidaikie apa nanu Ilamori te dukuya ninche, ooba enkadoro enye anaa enkadoro oo ltarakua negol oleng anaa ilkeek sapuki; aidaikie nanu ilng'anayio lenyena te shumata, o ntona enyena te kop. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayaua sii nanu intae aitayu te nkop e Misiri, narik intae ilarin artam tiong'ota, pee ipuonunu aaya enkop oo Lamori. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.6.1+NUM.6.2+NUM.6.3+NUM.6.4+NUM.6.5+NUM.6.6+NUM.6.7+NUM.6.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enki 6.1-8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Aitaa nanu embata oo layiok linyi iloibonok le Nkai ore embata oo lbarnot linyi Ilnasari, aimesipa ena, lo tung'ana le Israel?” Olaitoriani ojo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.2.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kake intooko intae Ilnasari enaisho, nintanapinapa iloibonok le Nkai aajoki ‘Emimbonisho’.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.2.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ng'ura, karogonyaki nanu intae enkop te wueji inyi, anaa enarogony enkop engarri nabore lolan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Keimin enkuetata te ilo oneneng, ore ilo ogol nemeitoki aata engolon enye; nemeitoki ilo magilani aidim aitajeu enkishui enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ilo oibung enkawuo nemeitashe, ore ilo oneneng too nkejek nemeitajeu kewan, nemeitajeu ilo oked embarta enkishui enye; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naa ore ilo ogol tau tialo lelo magil naa keyooki aisik ailanyisho meishopo te ina olong.” Olaitoriani ojo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.2.16"
            ]
          }
        }
